---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'

const DEMO_URL = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_DEMO_URL || 'https://shoreline-demo.onrender.com/menu'
---

<BaseLayout title="For Food Distributors (Dennis & Sysco Reps)" description="How ShorelineOps drives higher standing-order volume, eliminates customer churn, and provides distributor reps with dedicated portal tools.">
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-14">
        <div class="inline-block px-3.5 py-1 bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-950/70 border border-amber-200/70 dark:border-amber-800/60 rounded-full text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4 font-mono">
          Broadline Partner Program
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight mb-4">
          Turn Dietary Kitchens into <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-600 via-orange-500 to-amber-500 dark:from-amber-400 dark:via-orange-300 dark:to-amber-200">High-Volume Standing Accounts.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
          When assisted living kitchens guess their inventory on clipboards, order volumes fluctuate and emergency shortages happen. ShorelineOps automates par levels so facilities order consistently from their primary distributor.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 3 Key Distributor Value Props (Apple HIG Cards) -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-16 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
        <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-white/80 dark:bg-slate-900/80 backdrop-blur-xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 hover:border-amber-500/40 transition-all shadow-apple-card">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-3">📈</div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-1.5">Higher, Predictable Order Volume</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Facilities using Shoreline's suggested order generator maintain strict par levels, ordering weekly truck deliveries without skipping replenishment cycles.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-white/80 dark:bg-slate-900/80 backdrop-blur-xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 hover:border-amber-500/40 transition-all shadow-apple-card">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-3">⚡</div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-1.5">Zero IT Integration Headaches</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            No expensive custom EDI development or proprietary hardware required. Reps simply provide standard CSV order guides and receive clean purchase orders.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-white/80 dark:bg-slate-900/80 backdrop-blur-xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 hover:border-amber-500/40 transition-all shadow-apple-card">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-3">🛡️</div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-1.5">Dedicated Rep Portal (`/distributor`)</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Sales reps get direct portal access to update item SKUs, pack sizes, and contract unit pricing—keeping order guides up to date with zero friction.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- How Dennis Reps Use It -->
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 text-center shadow-apple-card">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Are you a Dennis or Sysco Healthcare Sales Rep?</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-xs sm:text-sm max-w-xl mx-auto mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          We provide free onboarding support for any regional healthcare account. We'll format your customer's order guide and pre-load their par levels in under 24 hours.
        </p>
        <a
          href="https://shoreline-demo.onrender.com/distributor"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex px-6 py-3 bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-slate-950 font-bold rounded-xl text-xs sm:text-sm transition-all shadow-sm shadow-amber-500/20"
        >
          Explore the Distributor Portal (`/distributor`) &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
